      "source_quote": "The angel of the LORD encampeth round about them that fear him, and delivereth them –Psalm 34:7.",
      "suggested_fix": "Render the English printed meaning more naturally in Modern Standard Arabic as a faithful equivalent of “them that fear him” (i.e., those who fear the LORD). Suggested wording: «مَلاكُ الرَّبِّ يَحُطُّ حَوْلَ الْمُخِيفِينَ لَهُ، وَيُنَجِّيهِمْ – مزمور 34:7.» or better: «مَلاكُ الرَّبِّ يَحُطُّ حَوْلَ الَّذِينَ يَخَافُونَهُ، وَيُنَجِّيهِمْ – مزمور 34:7.» Preserve verse reference exactly.",
      "translation_quote": "مَلَكُ الرَّبِّ يَحُطُّ حَوْلَ مُرْتَعِدِيهِ، وَيُنَجِّيهمْ – مزمور 34:7."
    },
